{"title": "Defensive Duellist", "pageid": 4936, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Defensive_Duellist", "categories": ["Class actions", "Reactions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Defensive_Duellist.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Defensive_Duellist.webp/300px-Defensive_Duellist.webp, /w/images/2/2e/Defensive_Duellist.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Defensive_Duellist.webp/300px-Defensive_Duellist.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Defensive_Duellist.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Defensive Duellist</b> is a reaction obtainable by a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">feat</a> of the same name. If you are attacked while wielding a <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">Finesse Weapon</a> weapon, you can temporarily increases your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>. You must have at least a 13 in <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> in order to take this <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When attacked with a melee attack, add your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a>, possibly causing attacks to miss. \n</p>\nRequires a <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">Finesse Weapon</a> you are <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficient</a> in.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Per turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Per turn</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\nGranted by features: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Duellist_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defensive Duellist (Feat)\">Defensive Duellist (Feat)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Though not explicitly stated, the weapon equipped in the <em>main hand</em> is required to have the <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">Finesse</a> property.</li>\n<li>Defensive Duellist <em>only</em> triggers when it is capable of turning a melee attack hit into a miss.</li>\n<li>Defensive Duelist does not change the user's Armour Class. Instead, it subtracts the user's Proficiency Bonus from  the enemy's attack roll.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlike similar reactions (<a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Master:_Block\" title=\"Shield Master: Block\">Shield Master: Block</a>), the icon for Defensive Duellist in the reactions tab does not \"gray out\" when the reaction is unavailable due to an incompatible equipped weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1574/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16052/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9215/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1023786/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n116.36%   57.507     18 Template:Trim\n100.00%   49.421      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   49.421      1 -total\n 22.82%   11.276      2 Template:Icon_text\n 21.68%   10.715      2 Template:ArmourClass\n 20.59%   10.177      1 Template:WeaponProperty\n 20.03%    9.898      1 Template:Icon_link\n 17.69%    8.744      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.81%    8.308      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.27%    8.041      2 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4936-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041344 and revision id 387699. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}